{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dc775de6e629a79dde07492e0b936d27cea2a10ac77aa76d34acfd9399362098", "ja": "（桃子の新しい衣装は、華やかさにプラスして、\nエネルギッシュな力強さを込めてもらった）", "zh": "（桃子的新服装在华丽之外，还融入了充满活力的强劲力量。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "365d230a13d65469e9b114678b69fc12af603f7c372193eb73076954c3503864", "ja": "今回の衣装もいい感じだね。お兄ちゃんも\nだんだん、桃子のことがわかってきたんじゃない？", "zh": "这次的服装感觉也很不错。哥哥也渐渐开始了解桃子了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b5b7eb5ab7df885a823e0646dab5e0895ed894fbf8835363bf2d9dd5883d0f26", "ja": "お、本当か！", "zh": "哦，真的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "26a2c36b308af247daa97fd883d4d5bad57b2d6786159c8176dab1ff39ead2a2", "ja": "だからって手抜きなんかしたらダメだよ？\nそういうの、すぐお客さんにはわかるんだから。", "zh": "可不能因此就偷懒哦？\n这种事，观众马上就能看出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1004_p", "source_sha256": "06c056fc97a3ea382e176c6289b8ce3981831051ca61ffc7d3df1deb59d195da", "ja": "もちろん。手抜きなんてしないよ。\n桃子を輝かせるためには、全力じゃないとな！", "zh": "那是当然。我怎么可能偷懒呢。\n为了让桃子绽放光芒，必须全力以赴才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "f14f248c4374b3d99a9b4939915411a6ad7695916a8dacf52b41ce46f6781a72", "ja": "そ、そう？　ならいいけど……。\nじゃあ今回は、褒めてあげるね♪", "zh": "是、是吗？那就好……\n那这次就夸夸你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "540e45383be9cb5ea8a02b9aa106e8f7e51787147430a71b67b07f1389c1b650", "ja": "桃子もお兄ちゃんも、プロなんだし。\nいつもカンペキで当然っていうのは、忘れないでね。", "zh": "桃子和哥哥都是专业人士。\n要记住，始终做到完美是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1007_p", "source_sha256": "746b1cddf788a2455d6b5ab2998aed7e3a76fb594ef7332673ceaf9c08e8aa43", "ja": "もちろんだ。気になるところがあれば、\nいつでも言ってくれ。", "zh": "当然。要是有什么在意的地方，随时都可以告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "b925f3e0aa3656142299dbdd4c1482419a18ebb3f8c180cdabd0b0919ce15be6", "ja": "気になるところ……。\nねえお兄ちゃん。最近、ちょっと思ったんだけど。", "zh": "在意的地方……  \n那个，哥哥。我最近稍微有件事在想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "100963c7d3acbb5ec0d2fdf3ab51ff2c383f886089f32abe6fef24df6fbcaf82", "ja": "『カンペキ』も、人によって違うよね？", "zh": "所谓的“完美”，也是因人而异的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8d62ae7799e6a74e455193ae3223eea22761caffbb72f83b017fc07964efc898", "ja": "？　まあ、そうかもな……？", "zh": "？嗯，也许吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "fc40e80cffb4e89db1fc0b59a5c3b4b110e5ac80ed5430bb3170a177b41df029", "ja": "だから、この衣装をカンペキにするなら……\n他の人にも、見てもらった方がいいのかなって。", "zh": "所以，要想把这套服装做到完美……\n我觉得还是让其他人也帮忙看看比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e6060d825a6076f13a47cc304d64491b431764116f93db22e8a3eb419858f2a8", "ja": "なるほど。", "zh": "原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "47225812b261da1422567ba1bdf748b8d1f536042d6d91bc78d218824a246f4d", "ja": "お兄ちゃんだって、お仕事の時は\nいろんな人に確認しながら進めるでしょ？", "zh": "哥哥工作的时候，也会一边向各种人确认一边进行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "7dabbe83de7b32dafa8fc26d7c053fa19a2c1727904c7460f5c540243cf10bb8", "ja": "それと同じだよ。カンペキだって思ってほしいのは、\n桃子を応援してくれるファンのみんななんだから。", "zh": "这也是一样的。因为想让桃子觉得完美的，是那些支持桃子的粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "3b4753c51b81951187bb453afd77cda6f1a0fb099fb98ce22e487c2830797672", "ja": "桃子とお兄ちゃんがカンペキだと思っても、\n絶対に安心ってわけじゃないもん。違う？", "zh": "就算桃子和哥哥觉得很完美，也不代表就绝对可以放心。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d615d201fd4a6f331a131ec3e995575c829a2cea88117c22fd71da29d183a40f", "ja": "ファンの人達の事まで考えられて、偉いな。\n桃子がそう言うなら、そうしよう。", "zh": "连粉丝们都能考虑到，真了不起啊。\n既然桃子都这么说了，那就这么做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "dfdf7e5242d8cf08bee189a82bf5eb4f5e19462ff8d710d3c0b033b691062fe4", "ja": "まあ……今までだったら、こういうことは\n言わなかったかもしれないけど。そんなに意外？", "zh": "嗯……要是换作以前，我可能不会说这种话。就这么意外吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1018_p", "source_sha256": "507373bc2acd263a24f1927bb859de3551199d890d13f65c60221b3c4f80ad81", "ja": "いいや。嬉しかっただけだよ。\n本当に、桃子はどんどん成長していくな。", "zh": "没有。只是觉得挺高兴的。\n桃子真的在不断成长呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "15cecc259a7072fd500babb7acc1efc4b9a65206512c6ec7cc0567a818c74d7a", "ja": "な、なに？　桃子だっていろいろ経験してるんだから、\nこれぐらい当然でしょ！", "zh": "怎、怎么了？桃子也经历过各种各样的事情，这点小事当然不在话下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "659d7a59a8f81b4ba85a6bd22d0f2f4ae61545bc3185a0f8867203088b22c1c9", "ja": "じゃあお兄ちゃん、みんなを呼んできて？\n衣装を汚すといけないから、桃子はここで待ってるね♪", "zh": "那哥哥，去把大家叫来吧？要是不小心把演出服弄脏就不好了，所以桃子就在这里等你哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0664_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0664_1021_p", "source_sha256": "dc130bedfbffa40588d8d11303a80457e31beff1224f83f70ebfe7c32c42c498", "ja": "（相手を信頼して、任せてくれる……。桃子から受ける\n信頼は、かけがえのないものだ。必ず応えるぞ……！）", "zh": "（她愿意信任对方，把事情交给对方去做……。桃子给予的信任，是无可替代的珍贵之物。我一定会回应这份信任……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
